{"screen_name": "Cloth_ke", "file": "Cloth_ke-e5fbd9", "name": "くろすけ🥐", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/752423090349494272/TidLWtf2.jpg", "header_url": null, "description": "ころさんのリスナー", "total_works": 12, "scraped_works": 12, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 3000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00"}], "music": [{"amount": 4000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 3000, "music": 4000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 3000, "max": 3000}, "music": {"min": 4000, "max": 4000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/Cloth_ke", "name": "Cloth_ke"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@Cloth_ke/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F752423090349494272%2FTidLWtf2.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d94f69cbf9fe4dbde501aea3b3878700", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F752423090349494272%2FTidLWtf2.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d94f69cbf9fe4dbde501aea3b3878700, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F752423090349494272%2FTidLWtf2.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4037407885b240289e44cd20136dc525 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F752423090349494272%2FTidLWtf2.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dde77b4e8c70b1c87168d25ea56fc993 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "前回は素敵なイラストを描いて頂きありがとうございました\n今回は音楽のリクエストさせていただきます\n\n■リクエスト内容・イメージ\n・書店で流れてそうなイメージの音楽の作成\n\n■曲調\n・ケルト音楽のような雰囲気\n・イメージワード「書店　童話　コーヒー」\n\n■長さ\n1分程でお願いしたいですが、くろすけさんにお任せしたいです\n\n■テンポ\n・ゆるやかで心拍を落ち着けるもの\n\n■使用用途\n・観賞用\n・運転中や創作の作業中に聴きます\n\n音楽の知識が疎く抽象的な表現になってしまい申し訳ありませんが\nくろすけさんが受けた印象で作品を作成して頂けたら嬉しいです\nご検討頂けましたら幸いです、よろしくお願いいたします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cloth_ke/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/592e9154/uploads/origins/a9cea9db-5d83-4ed2-b065-e76e56d4f8b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=017695dd5de8a636d98a23d7a39fd8de", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/592e9154/uploads/origins/a9cea9db-5d83-4ed2-b065-e76e56d4f8b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=017695dd5de8a636d98a23d7a39fd8de, https://si.imgix.net/592e9154/uploads/origins/a9cea9db-5d83-4ed2-b065-e76e56d4f8b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=476e0db4561c63f7592ec75b27217ff7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/592e9154/uploads/origins/a9cea9db-5d83-4ed2-b065-e76e56d4f8b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74bf31cdd7042d8e018c158d1989a922 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "サイズはフルHD(横1920×1080)\n3人のキャラクターが楽しそうにしている\n用途:Youtube配信での利用およびデスクトップ背景\n\n1人目\n黒髪ショートの男の子\n目の色は赤\n中学生くらい\nカッターシャツにスラックス\n水色のベスト\nコンバースみたいな黒い靴\n\n2人目\n金髪肩甲骨の下ぐらいまであるロングヘアの女の子\n目の色はブラウン\n一応成人\n赤いアロハシャツにデニムのショートパンツ\nサンダル\n\n3人目\n頭のてっぺんから耳のあたりまで黒髪\n耳から下は金髪\nボブ\n右の耳から前髪にかけて三つ編みを緑のリボンで結わえる\n首に錠前モチーフのチョーカー\n水色の中国の服みたいな感じで袖が広がっている\n服の胸部分だけ止めて首やお腹ははだけている\nみぞおちのあたりに鍵を2本ぶら下げている\n下腹からかぼちゃパンツのように広がって裾は閉じている青いズボン\nズボン上から伸びて左右にクロスしている黒い帯\nスウェーデンの国旗のような黄色のラインが左肩から左裾と胸に入っている\n\n参考までに資料を添付いたします\n\n以上、よろしくお願いいたします\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/ofAAtzuNNenCKdiq6", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cloth_ke/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/17eb8008/uploads/origins/039fb48c-cd74-4bb9-a2b3-c4e057406a51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f123501aa9a9c400a5f1ac666ba7fd88", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/17eb8008/uploads/origins/039fb48c-cd74-4bb9-a2b3-c4e057406a51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f123501aa9a9c400a5f1ac666ba7fd88, https://si.imgix.net/17eb8008/uploads/origins/039fb48c-cd74-4bb9-a2b3-c4e057406a51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c16912feecda716faa31f970be4ef825 2x, https://si.imgix.net/17eb8008/uploads/origins/039fb48c-cd74-4bb9-a2b3-c4e057406a51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f151d83d60774d6d2b787dd05483de34 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "先生のイラスト見てたら我慢できなくなったので依頼させていただきます！\nあんまりこういう系のサービスを利用したことがないので変だったらごめんなさい！\n\n■依頼内容\n･病み系のかわいい男の娘二人\n･一人は暗めのハーフアップ男子\n･一人は少しだけ暗めのポニーテル男子\n･二人は恋仲っぽい雰囲気\n\nざっくりこんなかんじでお願いしたいです！\nよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cloth_ke/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/37cacd35/uploads/origins/380b6d48-7647-4af7-bd79-aad044906d49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf81c95ae8b64e5b22f3df812436fe77", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/37cacd35/uploads/origins/380b6d48-7647-4af7-bd79-aad044906d49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf81c95ae8b64e5b22f3df812436fe77, https://si.imgix.net/37cacd35/uploads/origins/380b6d48-7647-4af7-bd79-aad044906d49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c736e51847eac9778db0f1069c5c04f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/37cacd35/uploads/origins/380b6d48-7647-4af7-bd79-aad044906d49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b061630aac44f3b6f2530b5ba7b4a896 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私はキノと申します。私はあなたの芸術をとても楽しんでいます。\n\n私の彼女「はな」を描いていただけませんか？彼女は興奮しやすく、かわいいキツネです。ピンクが大好きです。\n\nかわいく描いてください。もしよかったら、彼女の好きなサンリオのキャラクターであるハローキティも入れてください。\n\nはな： https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15jKnDQGWj2gsBgpS4nqzsLF0kdCfZCEL\n\n私のリクエストに応えてくれてありがとうございました。\n\n- 木野\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15jKnDQGWj2gsBgpS4nqzsLF0kdCfZCEL", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cloth_ke/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4bb740f7/uploads/origins/ca6959cd-29ae-4eeb-a811-22e2664a6325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=772b83f22d0afe83dbaf878a03e6e6bf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4bb740f7/uploads/origins/ca6959cd-29ae-4eeb-a811-22e2664a6325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=772b83f22d0afe83dbaf878a03e6e6bf, https://si.imgix.net/4bb740f7/uploads/origins/ca6959cd-29ae-4eeb-a811-22e2664a6325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80f08a257ddd6902e92544091b57bfc6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4bb740f7/uploads/origins/ca6959cd-29ae-4eeb-a811-22e2664a6325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8cd8fc011453e3c466fff47bc1ab5ec 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I was hoping to get a 16:9 drawing for my character, named Plume! If not okay, an icon version would be fine~ \n\nHe is a “pretty guy” body type and is based on a light blue and white parakeet bird, with a short light blue haircut that has 90s anime style bangs and sticks out at the bottom, fluffy wings on his head in place of ears, small fangs, large gold round glasses and a large hooded jacket that has sleeves like feathers, oval blush that is permanently on his cheeks, a beauty mark right by his left eye, along with shoes that resemble a bird's claws and feet. There is also a small patch of black speckles on his jacket shoulders~\n\nI would love any sort of pose or extra details/ accessories of the costume that you're inspired to draw if you accept my request, and for the colors palette they are mostly shades of light blues, white, green for the eyes, peach for the permanent blush, and gold for accents! Also a transparent version as well if it's okay!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bmXwr4XFITooFTuWDXr3FFZn_TCCjBg9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cloth_ke/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dea34d81/uploads/origins/6332b859-0d76-42eb-ac3f-67709fff1069?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6664718618fa21eadec9248c84b777f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dea34d81/uploads/origins/6332b859-0d76-42eb-ac3f-67709fff1069?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6664718618fa21eadec9248c84b777f, https://si.imgix.net/dea34d81/uploads/origins/6332b859-0d76-42eb-ac3f-67709fff1069?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cbbaa265b737efb91c05fb533ab8c081 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dea34d81/uploads/origins/6332b859-0d76-42eb-ac3f-67709fff1069?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e44f120f29ef9890e3d282d2f270021 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello I love your drawing! I would love if you could draw my VTuber and her mascot , Lucky(dog) together if possible! If not, then just my VTuber is okay. I'd also like to use her for a schedule graphic and SNS (YouTube, thumbnails, Twitter, etc), so if possible, please make a transparent version too! My VTuber's personality is very happy-go-lucky and bubbly! Her theme is the sky/galaxy/stars. I'll leave the pose, style, and background up to you! Thank you!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/ChibiMiharu/status/1504686951965741056", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cloth_ke/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/86e69fd3/uploads/origins/0d4d297b-ee1d-4105-8327-3053ce57a907?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d51d2e007e8bb4533831632edc225d5e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/86e69fd3/uploads/origins/0d4d297b-ee1d-4105-8327-3053ce57a907?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d51d2e007e8bb4533831632edc225d5e, https://si.imgix.net/86e69fd3/uploads/origins/0d4d297b-ee1d-4105-8327-3053ce57